ps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199650/extras/7ad7aea534028cdc3435883d89e6f9d9.avif?t=1786525618\" width=1059 height=203 /></span>How far will you go to find the truth? Your mental state directly affects your actions, and even how you interpret events. Falling into apathy or wandering into mania may lead you to new insights... or to your death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199650/extras/6dd7239b453f2d6cd25eb5481a56b656.poster.avif?t=1786525618\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199650/extras/6dd7239b453f2d6cd25eb5481a56b656.webm?t=1786525618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199650/extras/6dd7239b453f2d6cd25eb5481a56b656.mp4?t=1786525618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "In this psychological horror game, you are a doctor with only 12 days to save a town from a mysterious plague. Make ruthless decisions and diagnose with precision. Shape the town's future and rewrite the past. Hold yourself together while it all falls apart.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Pathologic 3 is brilliant, beautiful, and most importantly, approachable for both new players and those like myself, who have been captivated by this world since the original game launched 20 years ago.”<br>Polygon<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199650/7df86dc0b47a90b34eadf2ae8bbe6c9f7d61b97e/header.jpg?t=1786525618", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199650/667e3c8e99eb67571b054f368e0f7